  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="59170442-f416-51e0-a71a-53cf1719aee6" activityNameId="1c0e5b27-8908-539e-9f62-facf747eaf95" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transport, aircraft, freight, Betrieb</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, aircraft, freight, Betrieb
Inventory refers to the entire transport life cycle. The avereage aircraft transport operated by Lufthansa Group includes 3.7% short-haul, 8.0% medium-haul and 88.4% long-haul flights. The mix of short-, medium- and long-haul flights is based on information from Lufthansa Group.;
UUID: 2c68ca3e-1097-36c2-8088-485ef8e23aff
The dataset describes the operation of aircrafts including taxying, take-off and landing covering fuel consumption and operation emissions. Aircraft manufacture and maintenance, airport construction, operation and dismantling are inputs to this dataset
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Aircraft operation modelled based on passenger aircrafts operated by Lufthansa Group in 2019. The emission profiles distinguish between LTO and cruise.
Time period: Start date refers to emission factor data. End date refers to year of reporting fuel consumption and transport activities
Production volume: 8'899'000'000tkm
Sampling: fuel consumption is based on corporate data, emission profiles are based on FOEN statistics 
Extrapolations: Allocation between passengers and freight based on weight (average passenger weight between 158kg and 163kg); allocation between booking classes based on seat area.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2c68ca3e-1097-36c2-8088-485ef8e23aff.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
